{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54076","headline":"[拟]送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 严都","name":"[拟]送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"广成何必挂朝衣，已奉玄珠佐万机。\n还蹑旧衣凫舃去，不将新赐鹤书归。\n（先生因辞宠禄，竟追成命）暂凭风驭游清禁，终泛仙槎出紫微。\n今日汉庭因少别，人间无限白云飞。\n（将离洛都，历别公卿十数事，其处皆有白云起。\n见《会稽掇英总集》卷二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严都","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54076.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54076","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}